<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/medical">Medical</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Medical PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Medical products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/hearing-aid-assembly"><span class="abbr">HA</span><span class="label">Hearing Aid Assembly</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/mems-sensors"><span class="abbr">MS</span><span class="label">Medical MEMS &amp; Sensors</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/medical/pcba"><span class="abbr">PB</span><span class="label">Medical PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/wireless-charging"><span class="abbr">WC</span><span class="label">Wireless Charging</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the device does and the regulatory route it follows and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Medical &middot; Medical PCBA &amp; Box Build</div><h1 class="mk-h1">PCB assembly and box build for medical devices</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures compact PCB and flex assemblies for hearing devices, wearable diagnostics and other miniature medical electronics. Capabilities include adhesiveless multi-layer flex, fine-pitch flip-chip assembly, miniature passive placement, underfill and coating, controlled folding and laser depaneling.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-pcba" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);aspect-ratio:1600/824;"><img src="/images/photos/mk-medical-card-pcba.webp" alt="Medical PCBA under inspection beside the finished imaging system" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" /></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-pcba" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">The processes below run on dedicated medical lines under an ISO 13485 quality system.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Flex and rigid-flex circuits</span></div><div class="desc">Two- and four-layer adhesiveless flex down to approximately 5 mil total thickness, with 2 mil lines and spaces and 2 mil blind vias.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Flip chip and miniature passives</span></div><div class="desc">Fine-pitch bare die in solder-bump, gold-bump and gold-plated formats, placed on flex or rigid board alongside 0201 and 01005 passives.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Underfill, coating, folding and depaneling</span></div><div class="desc">Automated underfill and coating dispense with thermal or air cure, controlled multi-step folding into the device shape, and laser depaneling and marking.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Documented, traceable build</span></div><div class="desc">Controlled work instructions, formal change management and material, process and parameter traceability recorded throughout production.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See SMT Assembly for the placement accuracy, solder paste inspection, optical inspection, X-ray and test processes applied across these assemblies.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/smt-assembly">Explore SMT Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/box-build">Explore Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-plate pl-fade mk-turnkey" data-plate-role="capability"><div class="art"><img src="/images/photos/mk-medical-turnkey.webp" alt="" style="object-position:left center;" /><span class="tk-cap">Electronic insect bite healer</span></div><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Turnkey service</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Starting from IC through to packed medical device</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 18px;">Hana can run the complete build of a miniature medical device within one manufacturing program. Flex assembly, flip-chip attach, miniature passive placement, underfill and coating, folding and laser depaneling are followed by box build, functional test and final packing.</p><ul class="tk-list"><li><span class="t">Box build</span>Integration of the assembly into the finished device, including enclosure and housing assembly, cabling and wire harnesses, potting and sealing.</li><li><span class="t">Functional test</span>Finished devices are tested on product-specific rigs developed in-house.</li><li><span class="t">Packing and shipment</span>Finished units can be packed to the customer&rsquo;s specification and shipped directly or drop shipped.</li></ul><p class="tk-note">Where individual processes are performed at another Hana site, they remain within the group&#39;s controlled manufacturing and change-management structure.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What medical products can Hana build boards for?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures boards for patient-monitoring and diagnostic equipment, together with miniature flex and flip-chip circuits for hearing, wearable and drug-delivery devices. Assemblies can be supplied as PCBAs or integrated into the finished device depending on program scope.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana assemble flip chip and flex for medical devices?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Fine-pitch flip-chip die using solder-bump, gold-bump or gold-plated formats can be assembled on multi-layer adhesiveless flex alongside 0201 and 01005 passives, with underfill, coating and multi-step folding available within the same manufacturing program. Flip chip bonding methods are described on <a href="/capabilities/microelectronic-assembly/precision-flip-chip">Precision Flip Chip Bonding</a>.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does ISO 13485 mean for how a board is built?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Under ISO 13485, each build follows controlled work instructions, and changes to materials or process go through formal change management. Inspection results are recorded, and materials, process steps and parameters remain traceable through the build.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="/markets/medical" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Medical market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your medical board program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>

